              <p>
                PS PLAZA, 532/1026, RASULGARH, <br />
                BHUBANESHWAR - 751010
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="mb-4">
              <h3>OVERSEAS OFFICE - </h3>
              <p>
                6860 DALLAS PKWY, #200<br />
                PLANO, TX 75024​​
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="mb-4">
              <h3>CONCTACT - </h3>
              <p>
                info@thecloudtree.ai<br />
                Ph : (+91) 9090973033
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="mb-3">
              <img src="./assests/images/linkedin.avif" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-6">
            <p>Send us a message and we’ll get back to you shortly.</p>
            <div class="form">
              <div class="mb-2">
                <label class="">Full name</label>
                <input name="full-name" class="" type="text" placeholder="Add your name" required="" maxlength="100"
                  autocomplete="off" value="">
              </div>
              <div class="mb-2">
                <label class="">Email</label>
                <input name="email" class="" type="text" placeholder="e.g., email@example.com" required=""
                  maxlength="100" autocomplete="off" value="">
              </div>
              <div class="mb-2">
                <label class="">Subject</label>
                <input name="full-name" class="" type="text" placeholder="e.g., Support" required="" maxlength="100"
                  autocomplete="off" value="">
              </div>
              <div class="mb-2">
                <label class="">Your Message</label>
                <textarea class="" placeholder="Enter text here" aria-required="false" cols="50" rows="4"></textarea>
              </div>
              <div class="mb-2">
                <button aria-disabled="false" class="btn">Send</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </footer>

    <div class="bottom-footer">
